    "body": "`001e001` conforms to the requirements in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-microsyntaxes.html#floating-point-numbers as far as I can see.\r\n\r\n`001e001` decomposes into the following:\r\n\r\n* A series of one or more ASCII digits.\r\n* Either a U+0065 LATIN SMALL LETTER E character (e) or a U+0045 LATIN CAPITAL LETTER E character (E).\r\n* A series of one or more ASCII digits.\r\n\r\nIt’s not required to have any additional components. Those together make it sufficiently conforming.",
